      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.2103 - It is narrated by Muhammad ibn Sinan, from Abdul-A‘la ibn A‘yan, who said:\n\"I asked Abu Abdullah (as) about a man who engaged in sexual relations with his wife at night while performing i'tikaf during the Month of Ramadan.\nImam (as) said: 'He must pay one expiation.'\nI then asked: 'What if he engaged in sexual relations during the day?'\nImam (as) said: 'He must pay two expiations.'\""
        ]
      }
